<title>CANADA: CWB, WCE grain prices unavailable due to holiday.</title>
<headline>CWB, WCE grain prices unavailable due to holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Wheat Board and Winnipeg Commodity Exchange daily cash grain prices were unavailable on Monday due to the Victoria Day holiday.</p>
<p>The next updates will be issued when the institutions reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Due to the national holiday Manitoba grain and pork prices were also not issued on Monday and will resume on Tuesday. (Winnipeg bureau 204 947 3548)</p>
